l has amazing food. My resort showed low availability too but my agent got me a block by wiggling the dates just a bit. I would be happy to refer them if you&#039;d like.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898108,"PostDate":1433802466,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you tried getting a travel agent to try to get a block of rooms for you? Azul has amazing food. My resort showed low availability too but my agent got me a block by wiggling the dates just a bit. I would be happy to refer them if you'd like.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexamiri7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.69.100.245","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433286019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283361.jpg?_r=1433388782","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AlexandraAmiri","Id":283361,"Name":"AlexandraAmiri","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79248","Title":"Bride To Be ... April 2016","LastPostDate":1433802466},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
