{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.179.177","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79098,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2b4c3a832c15a251b401fff6e1171d4","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"Victoriabride\"] . As well we made a lovely email invitation for most of our guests including our wedding website. But we are mailing out few invitations for my parents and my dad&#039;s side  as they are much older and not tech savvy plus they only speak French. But everyone else seems to love our email invites. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1894133,"PostDate":1429814540,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282027\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282027-victoriabride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Victoriabride<\/span><\/a> . As well we made a lovely email invitation for most of our guests including our wedding website. But we are mailing out few invitations for my parents and my dad's side  as they are much older and not tech savvy plus they only speak French. But everyone else seems to love our email invites. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrina_cajuste@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.145.50.207","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414920518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Breena","Id":280962,"Name":"Breena","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79098,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf75e4c24dee9bf7f38590b666186687","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for all the ideas ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894164,"PostDate":1429825401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for all the ideas ladies!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423311313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79098,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb0488c2e61190535be5fd23c57df4b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I emailed my STDs (just posted and in my gallery if you want to see) basically the day after we got the group rate.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m mailing invitations because we have a couple people of the older generation on both sides who don&#039;t use email. &amp;nbsp;But we got a vistaprint deal on groupon and spent very little so far. &amp;nbsp;We&#039;re having everyone RSVP on our website as well, partly to cut costs and partly because we would have rsvps coming in from Canada, UK, Australia, USA &amp;amp; Ireland - so we didn&#039;t want anything to get lost in the mail.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895743,"PostDate":1431073664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I emailed my STDs (just posted and in my gallery if you want to see) basically the day after we got the group rate.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm mailing invitations because we have a couple people of the older generation on both sides who don't use email. \u00a0But we got a vistaprint deal on groupon and spent very little so far. \u00a0We're having everyone RSVP on our website as well, partly to cut costs and partly because we would have rsvps coming in from Canada, UK, Australia, USA & Ireland - so we didn't want anything to get lost in the mail.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421424569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1427826222","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79098,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37423c8985dc43e34d3335f6d018540a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Victoriabride\" post=\"1893926\" timestamp=\"1429715003\"]\nWe have decided not to do invitations, and are sending a nice email with all the travel and resort information. I find this way to be more efficient and less costly (we are on a tight budget and cutting costs wherever we can). A part of me is thinking that we should be doing a proper invite. Most of our guests already know the dates and have confirmed they are coming. Has anyone out there done an email for an invitation and how did it go over?! Silly thing to be worried over, I know... but I have been very indecisive on this and am running out of time!![\/quote]\nWe are not doing invitations either. We sent out STD&#039;s and all of guests confirmed and put their deposit down, so we think its silly to know send out an invitation which invites our guests even though they have already paid their deposit. So instead, when we receive our flight details (Wedding isn&#039;t until May 2016) we will be sending out a \"newsletter\" with the flight info \/ other important info. We will also be including our personalized luggage tags for everyone. Most will be hand delivered so we don&#039;t have to worry about postage.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896053,"PostDate":1431441634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Victoriabride, on 22 April 2015 - 10:03 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We have decided not to do invitations, and are sending a nice email with all the travel and resort information. I find this way to be more efficient and less costly (we are on a tight budget and cutting costs wherever we can). A part of me is thinking that we should be doing a proper invite. Most of our guests already know the dates and have confirmed they are coming. Has anyone out there done an email for an invitation and how did it go over?! Silly thing to be worried over, I know... but I have been very indecisive on this and am running out of time!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are not doing invitations either. We sent out STD's and all of guests confirmed and put their deposit down, so we think its silly to know send out an invitation which invites our guests even though they have already paid their deposit. So instead, when we receive our flight details (Wedding isn't until May 2016) we will be sending out a \"newsletter\" with the flight info \/ other important info. We will also be including our personalized luggage tags for everyone. Most\u00a0will be\u00a0hand delivered so we don't have to worry about postage.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426154786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.204.92.181","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79098,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81a46a999d9032c3f1384c59538483df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;\"&gt;Wow, nice thought ! I have a similar plan in mind too. I am planning to go for some online DIY wedding invitations that stands out from the rest. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.lejardin.com\/weddings-social-functions\/wedding-reception-banquet-hall\/&#039;&gt;My wedding party hall in Vaughan&lt;\/a&gt; is said to be decorated with blue and pink roses and red curtains. I am planning to get those colours highlighted since it\u2019s more of a theme wedding that\u2019s in my mind. Invitation needs to be a prior info to convey the theme. I am working on with some ideas.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896850,"PostDate":1432261099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;\">Wow, nice thought ! I have a similar plan in mind too. I am planning to go for some online DIY wedding invitations that stands out from the rest. <a href='http:\/\/www.lejardin.com\/weddings-social-functions\/wedding-reception-banquet-hall\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>My wedding party hall in Vaughan<\/a> is said to be decorated with blue and pink roses and red curtains. I am planning to get those colours highlighted since it\u2019s more of a theme wedding that\u2019s in my mind. Invitation needs to be a prior info to convey the theme. I am working on with some ideas.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryjhildebrandt@gustr.com","IpAddress":"205.204.92.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432260823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mary5026","Id":283197,"Name":"Mary5026","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
