{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":21,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2154,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1859131,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276164,"Name":"shelikespink","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276164.jpg?_r=1401826611","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1405110366,"LastPoster":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":67,"Preview":{"Id":1859131,"PostDate":1405110366,"PostContent":"Hi everyone, I'm trying to make a budget and I am wondering the approx cost of wedding photograph...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaleenalisa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.245.202.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389979103,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276164.jpg?_r=1401826611","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shelikespink","Id":276164,"Name":"shelikespink","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.23.105","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73fc280fda6f3e171f7534d81324fbf9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone,\n\n\nI&#039;m trying to make a budget and I am wondering the approx cost of wedding photography in Cancun for 6-8 hours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am doing engagement photos here at home and the photographers have given me a quote for my destination wedding, but it&#039;s pretty high, plus I would need to cover their flight\/hotel. It would be great to get an idea of what to expect!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859131,"PostDate":1405110366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<br><br>\nI'm trying to make a budget and I am wondering the approx cost of wedding photography in Cancun for 6-8 hours.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am doing engagement photos here at home and the photographers have given me a quote for my destination wedding, but it's pretty high, plus I would need to cover their flight\/hotel. It would be great to get an idea of what to expect!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaleenalisa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.245.202.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389979103,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276164.jpg?_r=1401826611","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":240,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shelikespink","Id":276164,"Name":"shelikespink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by kmk2016, 11 July 2014 - 08:56 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1405112193,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd384a69c2fd6da5701b36a63626fdc2","RawContent":"Depending on what style you are looking for, and the quality of the work it&#039;s a pretty broad spectrum. $1000-$5000.... You are best to read some reviews and email for quotes to a few photographers you are interested in. It&#039;s the only way to get a true sense since there are simply too many variables. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1859141,"PostDate":1405112147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Depending on what style you are looking for, and the quality of the work it's a pretty broad spectrum. $1000-$5000.... You are best to read some reviews and email for quotes to a few photographers you are interested in. It's the only way to get a true sense since there are simply too many variables. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390238608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.14.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07a4aa41575950c59d4d462b779ed424","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;And on top of that, they all work different numbers of hours for the prices they charge. So for the amount of time you want - 6 to 8 hours - you&#039;re probably going to be looking at the higher end of the price range that @[member=\"kmk2016\"] mentioned. Definitely start looking through the photographers and emailing them for what their price structure is. keep in mind as well that they can book up quickly so be sure to give yourself lots of time.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859150,"PostDate":1405116509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>And on top of that, they all work different numbers of hours for the prices they charge. So for the amount of time you want - 6 to 8 hours - you're probably going to be looking at the higher end of the price range that @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a> mentioned. Definitely start looking through the photographers and emailing them for what their price structure is. keep in mind as well that they can book up quickly so be sure to give yourself lots of time.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.58.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1535eb6c7a4ba07e22457cfb521b494","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dear Shelikespink:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes It depends how many photos do you want and the style of session. But, If you let me to give you some information about us, we have different packages and prices that offered, and If you compare the prices VS service quality and product quality, you&#039;ll see that we are the best choice, let me inform you that this statement is not only our opinion, the Conde Nast Brides Magazine -&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;the UK\u2019s leading Brides magazine from the publisher of&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GLAMOUR&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOGUE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;has&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;profiled Pixan Photography&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;one of only 20 International Photography studios from across the World&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;the exclusive photography studio that is based in Mexico&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;So if you are looking for something \"special, romantic, contemporary and with a lot of fun\" please let us to show our proposal. In the links below that, you can see more information about packages &amp;amp; prices.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Wedding Welcome Guides&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/mad.ly\/cabe64&#039; title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0f72da;\"&gt;Wedding Photography Welcome Guide - Pixan Photography&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Riviera Maya Trash The Dress Adventure Welcome guides - great for honeymooners&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/mad.ly\/3112b4&#039; title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0f72da;\"&gt;Riviera Maya Trash The Dress Photo Shoot Adventure - Welcome Guide - Pixan Photography&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;We can provide you a personalized attention through email. If you want to need that, please contact us, my email is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;ariadna.gdessavre@pixanphoto.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;I&#039;m very glad to know about your feelings and expectations in the best special day of your life!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Website: www.pixanphoto.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Fanpage on Facebook:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto&#039; title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0f72da;\"&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Warmest Regards ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#282828;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"&gt;Ariadna.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877715,"PostDate":1415110031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong>Dear Shelikespink:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes It depends how many photos do you want and the style of session. But, If you let me to give you some information about us, we have different packages and prices that offered, and If you compare the prices VS service quality and product quality, you'll see that we are the best choice, let me inform you that this statement is not only our opinion, the Conde Nast Brides Magazine -<span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">the UK\u2019s leading Brides magazine from the publisher of\u00a0<\/span><strong>GLAMOUR<\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">\u00a0and\u00a0<\/span><strong>VOGUE<\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">\u00a0has\u00a0<\/span><strong>profiled Pixan Photography<\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">\u00a0as\u00a0<\/span><strong>one of only 20 International Photography studios from across the World<\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">\u00a0and\u00a0<\/span><strong>the exclusive photography studio that is based in Mexico<\/strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">So if you are looking for something \"special, romantic, contemporary and with a lot of fun\" please let us to show our proposal. In the links below that, you can see more information about packages & prices.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Wedding Welcome Guides<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><a href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/cabe64' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#0f72da\">Wedding Photography Welcome Guide - Pixan Photography<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Riviera Maya Trash The Dress Adventure Welcome guides - great for honeymooners\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><a href='http:\/\/mad.ly\/3112b4' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#0f72da\">Riviera Maya Trash The Dress Photo Shoot Adventure - Welcome Guide - Pixan Photography<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">We can provide you a personalized attention through email. If you want to need that, please contact us, my email is:\u00a0<em>ariadna.gdessavre@pixanphoto.com\u00a0<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">I'm very glad to know about your feelings and expectations in the best special day of your life!!!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Website: www.pixanphoto.com<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Fanpage on Facebook:\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><strong><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#0f72da\">https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pixanphoto<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Warmest Regards <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#282828\"><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', sans-serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Ariadna.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1398713802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.9.78.17","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11d7f3e8397a73b3816e091d32c1bd20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Following this post. I am considering an outside photographer instead of the resort&#039;s photographer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877959,"PostDate":1415385847,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Following this post. I am considering an outside photographer instead of the resort's photographer.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411643062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.251.91.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a7107874593987cfe9ebd81bc8b0e20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I paid $2300+tip for 6 hours which was on the cheaper end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879794,"PostDate":1417799645,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I paid $2300+tip for 6 hours which was on the cheaper end.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ylan9383@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.251.91.140","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387198140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275646.jpg?_r=1388768729","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ylan9383","Id":275646,"Name":"ylan9383","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d05d7f886960967ac74ce74c69dfcece","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ylan9383\"] - Who was your photographer?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879845,"PostDate":1417867746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275646\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275646-ylan9383\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ylan9383<\/span><\/a> - Who was your photographer?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395591348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.251.91.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1d4175a4c5269a516288375a3ba0b41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;tygrrlily&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; cecilia dumas and associates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879944,"PostDate":1418037036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>tygrrlily<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0 cecilia dumas and associates.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ylan9383@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.251.91.140","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387198140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275646.jpg?_r=1388768729","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ylan9383","Id":275646,"Name":"ylan9383","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5bb041dc86ec1b40af0664e4e41e839","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I did a lot of research on pricing because it just seemed outrageous, and settled with Photos In Cancun. &amp;nbsp;They&#039;ve had rave reviews on this website and many others, and 6 hours of coverage costs $2000 (some photographers don&#039;t like their prices posted online, but theirs is listed on their website so I don&#039;t think they&#039;d mind). &amp;nbsp;That&#039;s the least expensive I could find, AND their pictures are gorgeous.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Many photographers, especially the \"big name\" ones, cost from $3000 - $5000.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879955,"PostDate":1418048898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did a lot of research on pricing because it just seemed outrageous, and settled with Photos In Cancun. \u00a0They've had rave reviews on this website and many others, and 6 hours of coverage costs $2000 (some photographers don't like their prices posted online, but theirs is listed on their website so I don't think they'd mind). \u00a0That's the least expensive I could find, AND their pictures are gorgeous.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Many photographers, especially the \"big name\" ones, cost from $3000 - $5000.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388713897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1431444128","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.95.19.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90c43df32d35b85f219fe9df2d0bc164","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am SO beyond thrilled that had to share my excitement with other Brides who might be on the same search I have been on for a LONG time!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone currently shopping around for a destination photographer - Don&#039;t get stuck with the choices you think you only have! After MANY months of researching various destination photographers, getting their packages\/prices, then narrowing it down to the ones who were the \"best\" &lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of what I thought was available to me (but honestly still nothing special). Never did I think I would end up hiring someone from a different country (USA) of where I was from (Canada) and where my wedding was to be held (Mexico)! Not only is it totally do-able, but it was actually less expensive!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I can\u2019t help but to think finding this photographer was a \u201cmeant to be\u201d situation and now I will always remember the interesting meeting, which turned into the best thing that could have ever happened in finding MY photographer! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found \u201cBe Photography\u201d after seeing his images on the Iberostar Tucan\/Quetzal Facebook group a few months ago. I had actually commented on how GORGEOUS his pictures were and found myself longing to get the same quality for my own wedding at the same resort scheduled this upcoming December 1, 2015. James, of \u201cBe Photography\u201d, quickly responded to my comments and explained how he is also a professional travel agent (specializing in destination weddings) and if the wedding party group books their travel through him, his photography is actually free! Now, as FANTASTIC as that deal would have been! Unfortunately we had already booked all travel and I sadly thought the option was closed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Soooo! The search continued\u2026 Looking through different Mexican photographers portfolios, not really finding anything that \u201cpopped\u201d for me and prices that were wayyy too expensive (keeping in mind, I would also have to pay an \u201coutside vendor fee\u201d + day passes for a photographer &amp;amp; his\/her assistant AND also pay to feed both of them at my reception dinner! Woah!) Of course my resort had their own vendor, who didn\u2019t even have a website to view pictures and their package basically covered the ceremony only, so I wouldn\u2019t have any pictures of the dinner reception???.... Finally, feeling defeated, I settled on an outside vendor, who was all I found I could really afford. I contacted him to place my deposit, only to find out, not only would I have to pay the difference between Canadian $ to US $ (obviously not his fault), the outside vendor fee, 2 day passes and pay for 2 peoples dinners \u2013 but now I also had to pay a 5% fee, to pay his bill via PayPal! This didn\u2019t sit quite right with me, so I decided to take a few days to think about it\u2026&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Fast forward to a few days ago!\u2026 \u201cBe Photography\u201d posted more pictures on Facebook of a destination wedding in Mexico and again, I went through the photos saying \u201cthis is EXACTLY what I want!\u201d I private messaged him again, to compliment his work and before you know it, we started discussing options for him to be my photographer, without booking my travel. LADIES \u2013 I was BLOWN AWAY when I received his quote!!! Not only was it more affordable than ALL of the Mexican photographers I had been in contact with, but I was actually getting THREE DAYS of photography (rehearsal dinner, entire wedding day\/night coverage, PLUS the day after\/trash the dress session) for less than what it was going to cost me, to hire locally! UNBELIEVABLE!!! Since he would actually be staying at the resort, there was no more \u201coutside vendor fees\u201d or day passes required! Now I get to work with a photographer, whom I LOVE his images and KNOW that I am going to have the most amazing memories captured, guaranteed!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also have to mention, the communication has been fantastic and I know everything is going to be completely covered! From the initial online video meeting\/conference, to the detailed, easy to understand contract \u2013 which clearly outlined everything I was receiving (with WAYYYY more than what ANY other photographer offered!!!) I was able to pay a VERY reasonable deposit via an actual credit card processor, registered to an actual business - I am left alleviated! One less stress for a Bride is always a good thing!!! lol!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can find \u201cBe Photography\u201d on the WeddingWire website and with his impressive 194 positive reviews and a 5\/5 star rating, I hope this review will help any other Brides out here, who don\u2019t want to settle for anything less than what they deserve!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/be-photography-llc-fallston\/ebd3e79e272f2633.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/be-photography-llc-fallston\/ebd3e79e272f2633.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Be Photography Website:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bephotography.net\/pricing-2\/caribbean-and-international\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bephotography.net\/pricing-2\/caribbean-and-international\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890321,"PostDate":1426981515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am SO beyond thrilled that had to share my excitement with other Brides who might be on the same search I have been on for a LONG time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone currently shopping around for a destination photographer - Don't get stuck with the choices you think you only have! After MANY months of researching various destination photographers, getting their packages\/prices, then narrowing it down to the ones who were the \"best\" <span><span><span>of what I thought was available to me (but honestly still nothing special). Never did I think I would end up hiring someone from a different country (USA) of where I was from (Canada) and where my wedding was to be held (Mexico)! Not only is it totally do-able, but it was actually less expensive!!!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can\u2019t help but to think finding this photographer was a \u201cmeant to be\u201d situation and now I will always remember the interesting meeting, which turned into the best thing that could have ever happened in finding MY photographer! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found \u201cBe Photography\u201d after seeing his images on the Iberostar Tucan\/Quetzal Facebook group a few months ago. I had actually commented on how GORGEOUS his pictures were and found myself longing to get the same quality for my own wedding at the same resort scheduled this upcoming December 1, 2015. James, of \u201cBe Photography\u201d, quickly responded to my comments and explained how he is also a professional travel agent (specializing in destination weddings) and if the wedding party group books their travel through him, his photography is actually free! Now, as FANTASTIC as that deal would have been! Unfortunately we had already booked all travel and I sadly thought the option was closed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Soooo! The search continued\u2026 Looking through different Mexican photographers portfolios, not really finding anything that \u201cpopped\u201d for me and prices that were wayyy too expensive (keeping in mind, I would also have to pay an \u201coutside vendor fee\u201d + day passes for a photographer & his\/her assistant AND also pay to feed both of them at my reception dinner! Woah!) Of course my resort had their own vendor, who didn\u2019t even have a website to view pictures and their package basically covered the ceremony only, so I wouldn\u2019t have any pictures of the dinner reception???.... Finally, feeling defeated, I settled on an outside vendor, who was all I found I could really afford. I contacted him to place my deposit, only to find out, not only would I have to pay the difference between Canadian $ to US $ (obviously not his fault), the outside vendor fee, 2 day passes and pay for 2 peoples dinners \u2013 but now I also had to pay a 5% fee, to pay his bill via PayPal! This didn\u2019t sit quite right with me, so I decided to take a few days to think about it\u2026<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Fast forward to a few days ago!\u2026 \u201cBe Photography\u201d posted more pictures on Facebook of a destination wedding in Mexico and again, I went through the photos saying \u201cthis is EXACTLY what I want!\u201d I private messaged him again, to compliment his work and before you know it, we started discussing options for him to be my photographer, without booking my travel. LADIES \u2013 I was BLOWN AWAY when I received his quote!!! Not only was it more affordable than ALL of the Mexican photographers I had been in contact with, but I was actually getting THREE DAYS of photography (rehearsal dinner, entire wedding day\/night coverage, PLUS the day after\/trash the dress session) for less than what it was going to cost me, to hire locally! UNBELIEVABLE!!! Since he would actually be staying at the resort, there was no more \u201coutside vendor fees\u201d or day passes required! Now I get to work with a photographer, whom I LOVE his images and KNOW that I am going to have the most amazing memories captured, guaranteed!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also have to mention, the communication has been fantastic and I know everything is going to be completely covered! From the initial online video meeting\/conference, to the detailed, easy to understand contract \u2013 which clearly outlined everything I was receiving (with WAYYYY more than what ANY other photographer offered!!!) I was able to pay a VERY reasonable deposit via an actual credit card processor, registered to an actual business - I am left alleviated! One less stress for a Bride is always a good thing!!! lol!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can find \u201cBe Photography\u201d on the WeddingWire website and with his impressive 194 positive reviews and a 5\/5 star rating, I hope this review will help any other Brides out here, who don\u2019t want to settle for anything less than what they deserve!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/be-photography-llc-fallston\/ebd3e79e272f2633.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingwi...9e272f2633.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Be Photography Website:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bephotography.net\/pricing-2\/caribbean-and-international\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bephotogr...-international\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413453948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77507","Title":"Cost For Photographer In Cancun?","LastPostDate":1429216670},"Pages":{"TotalItems":21,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
