Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ff7831764e2641e3e5779fd38fd374f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;nde062010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I read one Barcelo review about the judge asking if they wanted the ceremony in spanish or english .. Do they usually give you a choice or was that a random thing?\n \n \n The tall white gazebo at the Palace can be used as a site right?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Mine was in English and I don&#039;t even remember them asking me if I wanted it to be in Spanish. But if you want it to be in Spanish i don&#039;t think it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s going to be too hard to find a Spanish speaking minister!!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"mswink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n The white gazebo can be used for the ceremony. The only thing is that it&#039;s very out in the open.... Not really private. I loved the way it looked but i chose more private location between the palm trees..","Attachments":[],"Id":349929,"PostDate":1213983549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>nde062010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I read one Barcelo review about the judge asking if they wanted the ceremony in spanish or english .. Do they usually give you a choice or was that a random thing?<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> The tall white gazebo at the Palace can be used as a site right?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Mine was in English and I don't even remember them asking me if I wanted it to be in Spanish. But if you want it to be in Spanish i don't think it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s going to be too hard to find a Spanish speaking minister!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"mswink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The white gazebo can be used for the ceremony. The only thing is that it's very out in the open.... Not really private. I loved the way it looked but i chose more private location between the palm trees..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i248.photobucket.com\/albums\/gg163\/Philly_bride\/_nk34020.jpg\">http:\/\/i248.photobucket.com\/albums\/g...e\/_nk34020.jpg<\/a><br><br><span>My wedding pictures:<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/innayazmir\/WeddingAtBarcelo\">http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/innayazmir\/WeddingAtBarcelo<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"innayazmir@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1204120339,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208671.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Philly_Bride","Id":208671,"Name":"Philly_Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"382b90cbcf3d13cb6d2547221b845a25","RawContent":"what is the name of the area where you had your ceremony? I&#039;d like to have mine in the same spot but want to identify it clearly to the wc....","Attachments":[],"Id":350139,"PostDate":1213991100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                what is the name of the area where you had your ceremony? I'd like to have mine in the same spot but want to identify it clearly to the wc....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.unofficial-barcelo-maya.com\/site\/vacationcountdown\/vacationcounter.php?image=7&date=1231869600&dest=bmp&message=The+Wedding+is+on+January+17%2C+2009\">http:\/\/www.unofficial-barcelo-maya.c...ary+17%2C+2009<\/a><span>[br]Get your countdown ticker at <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.unofficial-barcelo-maya.com\">www.unofficial-barcelo-maya.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jonathanarnoldconsulting@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1206327419,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208896.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"morenaindc","Id":208896,"Name":"morenaindc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26b1c3eb8ce0874032315f324c3ba713","RawContent":"I can&#039;t remember did you have a civil ceremony? I want mine in english ... it just seems like all the resorts have the civil ceremonies in spanish and translate it to english ... I&#039;m not sure how I feel about that..","Attachments":[],"Id":350732,"PostDate":1214057920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I can't remember did you have a civil ceremony? I want mine in english ... it just seems like all the resorts have the civil ceremonies in spanish and translate it to english ... I'm not sure how I feel about that..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweetpea_ndh@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1204313092,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208690.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nde062010","Id":208690,"Name":"nde062010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4dd2aade19bc4ba5df568109bf2d3ea7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;morenaindc&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;what is the name of the area where you had your ceremony? I&#039;d like to have mine in the same spot but want to identify it clearly to the wc....&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I don&#039;t think there is a name for the ceremony location. It took place right in front of the closet buffet to the gazebo.","Attachments":[],"Id":351068,"PostDate":1214083446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>morenaindc<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">what is the name of the area where you had your ceremony? I'd like to have mine in the same spot but want to identify it clearly to the wc....<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I don't think there is a name for the ceremony location. It took place right in front of the closet buffet to the gazebo.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i248.photobucket.com\/albums\/gg163\/Philly_bride\/_nk34020.jpg\">http:\/\/i248.photobucket.com\/albums\/g...e\/_nk34020.jpg<\/a><br><br><span>My wedding pictures:<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/innayazmir\/WeddingAtBarcelo\">http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/innayazmir\/WeddingAtBarcelo<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"innayazmir@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1204120339,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208671.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Philly_Bride","Id":208671,"Name":"Philly_Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6354f29d24106e1df8db9ae0f495c98e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;nde062010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I can&#039;t remember did you have a civil ceremony? I want mine in english ... it just seems like all the resorts have the civil ceremonies in spanish and translate it to english ... I&#039;m not sure how I feel about that..&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;My ceremony was not legal. And my minister spoke great English!! Even the jokes were right on time!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":351071,"PostDate":1214083561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>nde062010<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I can't remember did you have a civil ceremony? I want mine in english ... it just seems like all the resorts have the civil ceremonies in spanish and translate it to english ... I'm not sure how I feel about that..<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>My ceremony was not legal. And my minister spoke great English!! Even the jokes were right on time!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i248.photobucket.com\/albums\/gg163\/Philly_bride\/_nk34020.jpg\">http:\/\/i248.photobucket.com\/albums\/g...e\/_nk34020.jpg<\/a><br><br><span>My wedding pictures:<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/innayazmir\/WeddingAtBarcelo\">http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/innayazmir\/WeddingAtBarcelo<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"innayazmir@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1204120339,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208671.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Philly_Bride","Id":208671,"Name":"Philly_Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b39b44a5fdc95a7a797f630e140bbb30","RawContent":"I know there&#039;s a few more Barcelo Brides I&#039;ve been chatting with!!! Let&#039;s get rockin&#039;!!!!!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rockon\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I have lots of pics and info and would love to chat with you all!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":417395,"PostDate":1218578327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know there's a few more Barcelo Brides I've been chatting with!!! Let's get rockin'!!!!!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rockon\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I have lots of pics and info and would love to chat with you all!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"davematthewsgal4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1211495529,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209544.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Davematthews16","Id":209544,"Name":"Davematthews16","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b6b4a00b72270946bf0608ba69249dd","RawContent":"I am willing to chat because I sent in my request for a wedding date and I am waiting to hear back, But I Would love to see pics and info on outside photog rule also any contact info for the wc there would be awesome!","Attachments":[],"Id":417409,"PostDate":1218579423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am willing to chat because I sent in my request for a wedding date and I am waiting to hear back, But I Would love to see pics and info on outside photog rule also any contact info for the wc there would be awesome!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF2906f60600MTQ3NjE4b3w1MzZzfFVudGlsbCBPdXIgV2VkZGluZyA.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cF2906f606...2VkZGluZyA.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"idzine28@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1216739179,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210712.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ash0628","Id":210712,"Name":"ash0628","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ed9a17f2089234d3c2ae6c771ab0a3b","RawContent":"Hi! I&#039;m getting married at the Barcelo Maya Palace on Dec. 22, 2008. I don&#039;t know what to do about a photographer. Should I bring one from Dallas (my hometown), find one in Playa, or trust the photographer at the Palace&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Have any of you seen (or heard good\/bad things about) the pictures taken by the Barcelo photographer?","Attachments":[],"Id":417410,"PostDate":1218579550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! I'm getting married at the Barcelo Maya Palace on Dec. 22, 2008. I don't know what to do about a photographer. Should I bring one from Dallas (my hometown), find one in Playa, or trust the photographer at the Palace<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Have any of you seen (or heard good\/bad things about) the pictures taken by the Barcelo photographer?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"diane_c_higgs@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1217517892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210901.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DCH777","Id":210901,"Name":"DCH777","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2db168503f1b95729d3085759f29134","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;DCH777&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi! I&#039;m getting married at the Barcelo Maya Palace on Dec. 22, 2008. I don&#039;t know what to do about a photographer. Should I bring one from Dallas (my hometown), find one in Playa, or trust the photographer at the Palace&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Have any of you seen (or heard good\/bad things about) the pictures taken by the Barcelo photographer?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Several brides have told me to NOT use the hotel photographer! If you have the $, I would fly in your own. If you are on some sort of budget, I would use a photog in Mexico. But, I would book it now if you are using someone in Mexico, because my first choice was booked 3 months ago for January &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n Also, they say they don&#039;t accept outside photographers, but my WC ASSURED me, with a day-pass it&#039;s fine. I&#039;m just not going to make a big deal and hope it&#039;s all ok :)","Attachments":[],"Id":417417,"PostDate":1218579957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>DCH777<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi! I'm getting married at the Barcelo Maya Palace on Dec. 22, 2008. I don't know what to do about a photographer. Should I bring one from Dallas (my hometown), find one in Playa, or trust the photographer at the Palace<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Have any of you seen (or heard good\/bad things about) the pictures taken by the Barcelo photographer?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Several brides have told me to NOT use the hotel photographer! If you have the $, I would fly in your own. If you are on some sort of budget, I would use a photog in Mexico. But, I would book it now if you are using someone in Mexico, because my first choice was booked 3 months ago for January <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> Also, they say they don't accept outside photographers, but my WC ASSURED me, with a day-pass it's fine. I'm just not going to make a big deal and hope it's all ok <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"davematthewsgal4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1211495529,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209544.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Davematthews16","Id":209544,"Name":"Davematthews16","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74b4d7d8e2410ab0fd167e2b8fccade0","RawContent":"Hello! I am getting married at Barcelo Maya January 24, 2009! I would love to hear any comments or see any pictures any of you may have! Do any of you have any information on menu choices or what the flower options look like? Also, what kind of centerpieces are you using\/did you use? Any information you have will certainly help! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":417580,"PostDate":1218589796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! I am getting married at Barcelo Maya January 24, 2009! I would love to hear any comments or see any pictures any of you may have! Do any of you have any information on menu choices or what the flower options look like? Also, what kind of centerpieces are you using\/did you use? Any information you have will certainly help! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily Married January 24, 2009 @ Barcelo Maya Palace!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"k.beebe@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1217300673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210846.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kbbride","Id":210846,"Name":"kbbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4630,"TotalPages":463,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":4620},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
