more pics of any weddings that took place here!!! I am getting married at the Palace in July 2009!\n \n Also, side question, does the resort have a swim up bar??\n \n Thanks!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":446370,"PostDate":1221050782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would love to see more pics of any weddings that took place here!!! I am getting married at the Palace in July 2009!<br \/> <br \/> Also, side question, does the resort have a swim up bar??<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jong140@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220912073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211645.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyLynnLong140","Id":211645,"Name":"JennyLynnLong140","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9515331cc917c86073c345b8803003d","RawContent":"Does anyone know if we can bring our own minister or do we have to use the one provided? Do most resorts let you or is it a rule you have to use theirs?","Attachments":[],"Id":446788,"PostDate":1221070441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Does anyone know if we can bring our own minister or do we have to use the one provided? Do most resorts let you or is it a rule you have to use theirs?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefpow@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1219677601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211373.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Steffi234","Id":211373,"Name":"Steffi234","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1e04deebc27542a5f7ccb9609ac6aa3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Philly_Bride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Mine was in English and I don&#039;t even remember them asking me if I wanted it to be in Spanish. But if you want it to be in Spanish i don&#039;t think it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s going to be too hard to find a Spanish speaking minister!!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"mswink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n The white gazebo can be used for the ceremony. The only thing is that it&#039;s very out in the open.... Not really private. I loved the way it looked but i chose more private location between the palm trees..&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;PhillyBride - who did you use for your wedding photography? It&#039;s absolutely gorgeous!","Attachments":[],"Id":446793,"PostDate":1221070691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Philly_Bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Mine was in English and I don't even remember them asking me if I wanted it to be in Spanish. But if you want it to be in Spanish i don't think it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s going to be too hard to find a Spanish speaking minister!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"mswink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The white gazebo can be used for the ceremony. The only thing is that it's very out in the open.... Not really private. I loved the way it looked but i chose more private location between the palm trees..<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>PhillyBride - who did you use for your wedding photography? It's absolutely gorgeous!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefpow@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1219677601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211373.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Steffi234","Id":211373,"Name":"Steffi234","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c27ad1385869d6642baba95a7ceebd57","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JennyLynnLong140&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I would love to see more pics of any weddings that took place here. I am having about 60 people in July 2009. \n \n Also, side question about the resort, does it have a swim up bar??\n \n Thanks!!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;What day are you getting married?? I&#039;m getting married there July 18th 2009!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":447407,"PostDate":1221124818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JennyLynnLong140<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I would love to see more pics of any weddings that took place here. I am having about 60 people in July 2009. <br \/> <br \/> Also, side question about the resort, does it have a swim up bar??<br \/> <br \/> Thanks!!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>What day are you getting married?? I'm getting married there July 18th 2009!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile159\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Erica & Doug<\/span><br><span>July 18th 2009<\/span><br><span>Barcelo Maya Palace<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.elizabethmedina.com\/ED09\">www.elizabethmedina.com\/ED09<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"douganderica@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1218424293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211106.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"eblum999","Id":211106,"Name":"eblum999","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"366aee5715ea959ad49a348c75d90827","RawContent":"We are getting married July 10, 2009 and then stayin an extra week so I will actually be there when you get married!! \n \n Have you picked your pacakage and everything yet&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;?","Attachments":[],"Id":447415,"PostDate":1221130043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married July 10, 2009 and then stayin an extra week so I will actually be there when you get married!! <br \/> <br \/> Have you picked your pacakage and everything yet<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jong140@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220912073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211645.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyLynnLong140","Id":211645,"Name":"JennyLynnLong140","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50e499128d3d56a65a8fae1be48b8f74","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Davematthews16&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;m getting married at the Palace on January 7, 2009! I have done A LOT of research, and have a great wedding planner here in Denver who&#039;s stayed at nearly every hotel in Cancun and Riviera Maya. She stayed at the Barcelo&#039; Palace about 3 weeks ago, and couldn&#039;t speak highly enough about it. It&#039;s nice to talk to someone first hand who has slept in the beds, eaten the food, and seen\/planned the weddings. I also have 2 co-workers who stayed there recently and they said it was amazing! I feel very confident that we made a great choice by picking the Barcelo&#039; Palace!!!! I would love any feedback :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Davematthews16,\n \n I&#039;m in Denver too. Can you email me your wedding planner&#039;s info. I tried to PM you but it wouldn&#039;t let me.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:kellyraeburton@yahoo.com\"&gt;kellyraeburton@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Thanks,\n Kelly","Attachments":[],"Id":448368,"PostDate":1221185572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Davematthews16<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm getting married at the Palace on January 7, 2009! I have done A LOT of research, and have a great wedding planner here in Denver who's stayed at nearly every hotel in Cancun and Riviera Maya. She stayed at the Barcelo' Palace about 3 weeks ago, and couldn't speak highly enough about it. It's nice to talk to someone first hand who has slept in the beds, eaten the food, and seen\/planned the weddings. I also have 2 co-workers who stayed there recently and they said it was amazing! I feel very confident that we made a great choice by picking the Barcelo' Palace!!!! I would love any feedback <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Davematthews16,<br \/> <br \/> I'm in Denver too. Can you email me your wedding planner's info. I tried to PM you but it wouldn't let me.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='mailto:kellyraeburton@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>kellyraeburton@yahoo.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Thanks,<br \/> Kelly\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellyraeburton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1218578686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211154.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kburton","Id":211154,"Name":"kburton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e8dfd5c1d801e78e762d7caabd58775","RawContent":"Hi there, does anyone have experience with using the photographers on site? I am just looking into options and think we will get an outside vendor, but just wanted to get some opinions. Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":453553,"PostDate":1221669073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi there, does anyone have experience with using the photographers on site? I am just looking into options and think we will get an outside vendor, but just wanted to get some opinions. Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t42184\">My Wedding Video<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t42167\">Barcelo Maya Palace Review<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannond4156@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221594318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211775.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shannond4156","Id":211775,"Name":"Shannond4156","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16876,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef3f7d21580fee6a5befd67593de947f","RawContent":"Hi everyone,\n We have been so undecided on a venue and are thinking of the Barcelo(hopefully they still have our date) and I have a painfully long list of questions for you all. Which Barcelo property is the best and which package did you choose and why? Any thoughts about the beach dinner vs. the banquet hall? Does anyone know how the food is and what food is served with the packages? How is their photographer? And does anyone have any pics?I love that you all have started this forum, it has been so helpful!\n \n Suzanne","Attachments":[],"Id":458025,"PostDate":1222048815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone,<br \/> We have been so undecided on a venue and are thinking of the Barcelo(hopefully they still have our date) and I have a painfully long list of questions for you all. Which Barcelo property is the best and which package did you choose and why? Any thoughts about the beach dinner vs. the banquet hall? Does anyone know how the food is and what food is served with the packages? How is their photographer? And does anyone have any pics?I love that you all have started this forum, it has been so helpful!<br \/> <br \/> Suzanne\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"suegrn@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220208527,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211492.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"suegrn@gmail.com","Id":211492,"Name":"suegrn@gmail.com","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4630,"TotalPages":463,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":4620},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
