 deals with Huracan Cafe and other venues outside hotels.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Creative documentary wedding photographer in Punta Cana!<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.juliaeskin.com'>www.juliaeskin.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julia@juliaeskin.com","IpAddress":"187.153.56.51","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1270586042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227096.jpg?_r=1392861573","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julia Eskin","Id":227096,"Name":"Julia Eskin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b586de8cd2e54f225ff2a9f62617722","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MsJillss\"] Did you ever get that info?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844963,"PostDate":1397765066,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273634\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273634-msjillss